Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:04.34,Nar,,0,0,0,,Every day, small businesses across India miss customer calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:08.25,Nar,,0,0,0,,The owner is busy at the counter, the shop has closed for the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.68,Nar,,0,0,0,,or two phones ring at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:13.50,Nar,,0,0,0,,Each missed call can be a booking that goes to the shop next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.58,Nar,,0,0,0,,Alaap is an AI front desk for these shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:21.79,Nar,,0,0,0,,It answers phone calls, WhatsApp and web chat in Hindi, Punjabi and English,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:23.92,Nar,,0,0,0,,the way customers actually speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:26.17,Nar,,0,0,0,,It books appointments, takes orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.78,Nar,,0,0,0,,and passes anything it can't solve to the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:33.50,Nar,,0,0,0,,Here's a live call to a demo salon. The caller's voice is synthesized;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.38,Nar,,0,0,0,,everything else is the live app.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:33.27,Nar,,0,0,0,,The booking lands in the owner's dashboard right away, with the customer's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.27,0:01:34.35,Nar,,0,0,0,,number and reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:38.47,Nar,,0,0,0,,A WhatsApp confirmation and a reminder are queued automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.47,0:01:42.41,Nar,,0,0,0,,WhatsApp isn't connected in this demo, so they wait in the outbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.57,Nar,,0,0,0,,The voice runs on Gnani AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:50.29,Nar,,0,0,0,,Gnani's Prisma speech recognition streams the caller's audio in real time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:53.76,Nar,,0,0,0,,understands Hindi, Punjabi, English and code-mixed speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:56.75,Nar,,0,0,0,,and detects when the caller has finished speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.05,0:02:00.46,Nar,,0,0,0,,Gnani's Timbre text-to-speech gives the assistant its voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:02.17,Nar,,0,0,0,,streamed sentence by sentence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:06.33,Nar,,0,0,0,,so it starts talking while the rest of the reply is still being prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.93,0:02:08.68,Nar,,0,0,0,,Owners run it in plain language.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:12.61,Nar,,0,0,0,,Asking it to make the facial nine hundred rupees updates the price list.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:17.34,Nar,,0,0,0,,New shops are set up in minutes: paste a rate card or a photo,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:21.65,Nar,,0,0,0,,and the language model reads the services, prices and hours for review.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:25.23,Nar,,0,0,0,,Under the hood: FastAPI and Next.js,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:29.03,Nar,,0,0,0,,with Gnani for speech and Google Gemini for reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:33.38,Nar,,0,0,0,,Nothing is booked until the customer hears a read-back and says yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:35.41,Nar,,0,0,0,,Row locks prevent double bookings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:38.45,Nar,,0,0,0,,and forty-four automated tests guard the behaviour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:43.29,Nar,,0,0,0,,Alaap gives every small shop a front desk that never misses a call,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:46.97,Nar,,0,0,0,,speaks its customers' language, and never invents a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:49.35,Nar,,0,0,0,,Alaap. Har call ka jawab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:42.54,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Sat Sri Akal! This is Riya from Glow Unisex Salon. This call is recorded. How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:50.90,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5CC8F0&}Caller:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Sat Sri Akal. Can I get a gents haircut tomorrow at 6:30 pm? My name is Rohit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:52.58,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Hello, Rohit ji!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:54.40,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} There's a free slot for a haircut tomorrow at 6:30 pm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:56.38,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Could you tell me your 10-digit mobile number?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:01:01.32,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Then I'll confirm the booking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:08.02,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5CC8F0&}Caller:{\c&HFFFFFF&} My number is 98123 45670.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:15.02,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Okay Rohit ji: tomorrow 6:30 pm, haircut with Gurpreet, ₹200. Shall I confirm it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.60,0:01:19.98,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5CC8F0&}Caller:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Yes, please confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:21.79,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:23.81,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Your booking number is 5161. A WhatsApp confirmation is on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:29.01,Call,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC8E65A&}Riya:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Anything else I can help with, Rohit ji?
